      "sourceHash": "e68b36b17cbd990802f57741cb75cf3a73fa66a61999b0cd70e3cf7d26cfb25f",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0009:0001",
      "source": "**parameter 1**: The output array, *z*.",
      "ko": "**매개변수 1**: 출력 배열, *z*.",
      "sourceHash": "69d609e8d7a4450f8b2eb9aec630feb46db2bdaecec1e4d3b4f5ab39732c7c8c",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0009:0002",
      "source": "**parameter 2**: The exponent input array, *y*.",
      "ko": "**매개변수 2**: 지수 입력 배열, *y*.",
      "sourceHash": "b44bc1256e514938f5c81f75a40e3d7fa43a386e53999a839dc70478aa7f8e7f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0009:0003",
      "source": "**parameter 3**: The base input array, *x*.",
      "ko": "**매개변수 3**: 밑 입력 배열, *x*.",
      "sourceHash": "3177713194b4a26edaa0137853cd2ff8c8e3dc390afb01f93e9a930d9d62a19c",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0009:0004",
      "source": "**parameter 4**: The number of elements in the arrays.",
      "ko": "**매개변수 4**: 배열의 요소 수.",
      "sourceHash": "169f6276ac4c10f73593d14da2e6060dad98a10ef0e63c3c4f08b9c4c27fbcc0",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:parameters:0010:0001",
      "source": "The following code shows an example of using [`vvpowf(_:_:_:_:)`](vvpowf(_:_:_:_:).md):",
      "ko": "다음 코드는 [`vvpowf(_:_:_:_:)`](vvpowf(_:_:_:_:).md) 사용 예시를 보여줍니다.",
      "sourceHash": "64f32fb8979d74592c440581177d3aa9cd5f23b83e4a238eee9d8b10aacc0134",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:parameters:0011:0001",
      "source": "**Swift**:",
      "ko": "**Swift**:",
      "sourceHash": "53d16fadeeea2a7aa768165ef570f1d2ab1018f4d6b4ce26128c54c576fbdb1a",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:parameters:0012:0001",
      "source": "```swift\nvar x: [Float] = [3, 2, 10, 6]\nvar y: [Float] = [2, 4, 3, 2]\nvar z = [Float](repeating: 0, count: x.count)\nvar n = Int32(x.count)\n \nvvpowf(&z, &y, &x, &n)\n \nprint(z) // [9.0, 16.0, 1000.0, 36.0]\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nvar x: [Float] = [3, 2, 10, 6]\nvar y: [Float] = [2, 4, 3, 2]\nvar z = [Float](repeating: 0, count: x.count)\nvar n = Int32(x.count)\n \nvvpowf(&z, &y, &x, &n)\n \nprint(z) // [9.0, 16.0, 1000.0, 36.0]\n```",
      "sourceHash": "ec74e2d94eee763e5121b2045e41a321ffb8baee52c06133012d19fa69f0266e",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:parameters:0013:0001",
      "source": "**Objective-C**:",
      "ko": "**Objective-C**:",
      "sourceHash": "b9ff84054868fd0b6412772e8cea2685d76cc712077d6834ad09a26b49b31897",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:parameters:0014:0001",
      "source": "```objc\nfloat x[] = {3, 2, 10, 6};\nfloat y[] = {2, 4, 3, 2};\nfloat z[4];\nint n = 4;\n \nvvpowf(z, y, x, &n);\n \nNSLog(@\"z: [%lf, %lf, %lf, %lf]\", z[0], z[1], z[2], z[3]);\n```",
      "ko": "```objc\nfloat x[] = {3, 2, 10, 6};\nfloat y[] = {2, 4, 3, 2};\nfloat z[4];\nint n = 4;\n \nvvpowf(z, y, x, &n);\n \nNSLog(@\"z: [%lf, %lf, %lf, %lf]\", z[0], z[1], z[2], z[3]);\n```",
      "sourceHash": "bf6fc53132bc452507dd893d4d678cf66839b216edcecfd3ac0358794a6fbe31",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:parameters:0015:0001",
      "source": "The following special values of `x` and `y` produce the given value of `z`:",
      "ko": "주어진 `z` 값에 대응하는 `x`와 `y`의 특수 값은 다음과 같습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "2a1022da4e6ae80e9d76a53fc2134d197112a840dbc73993b633d974b7abafca",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
